chapter.v:
“‘And in 


the last, 


days it shall be, God declares, that I will pour out my Spirit on all flesh, and your sons and your daughters shall prophesy, and your young men shall see visions, and your old men shall dream dreams;

And I 


will show, 


wonders in the heavens above and signs on the earth below, blood, and fire, and vapor of smoke;

For David 


